o;s 5 grids in King William County came in under 90% of normal in August to September in 41 of 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 161% of normal in April to May but only 47% in October to November. So far in 2026 the middle hit 38% in March to April and 140% in June to July. Grid 21512 shows a preliminary estimate of 138.9 for July to August 2026.</p>"}
